"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a rounded triangle. A magnification (pinch) gesture feeds the shape’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"), gated by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" paging; releasing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}